/page/The_Travails","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"The Travails\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."},{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Crab","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Crab","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Crab#:~:text=During%20The%20Travails%20%2C,by%20Emrakul%20%27s%20influence","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Crab\", section \"Innistrad\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}]},{"text":"Stories later describe it as the catastrophe that broke Innistrad, warped holy places, swelled the ranks of the undead and left the nights longer.","cites":["p:stories/episode-3-fall-house-betzold-2021-09-15","p:stories/sisters-2021-09-10"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-fall-house-betzold-2021-09-15","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sisters-2021-09-10"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Episode 3: The Fall of the House of Betzold","series":"Magic Story","authors":["K. Arsenault Rivera"],"date":"2021-09-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-fall-house-betzold-2021-09-15","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-fall-house-betzold-2021-09-15","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Episode 3: The Fall of the House of Betzold\" by K. Arsenault Rivera. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Sep 2021."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sisters","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Eugenia Triantafyllou"],"date":"2021-09-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sisters-2021-09-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sisters-2021-09-10","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sisters\" by Eugenia Triantafyllou. Magic